# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout commits CRLF, the macOS checkout sees a
# whole-file diff, and any shell script copied into a Linux container
# fails with a confusing "bad interpreter" error. This one file prevents
# the most common cross-platform annoyance in a mixed Windows/macOS team.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts genuinely need CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Never touch binaries.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.safetensors binary
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
